      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Push)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature with this weapon, you can push the creature up to 10 feet straight away from you.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Artillery Shells</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>The weapon holds up to 4 shells. You can use a Bonus Action to quickly reload all expended shells.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Shelling Upgrade</strong></p><p>Your weapon can now hold up to 5 shells. Additionally, all Thunder damage dealt by your Gunlance shells ignores Resistance to Thunder damage.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Shelling Strike</strong></p><p>The gunlance isn't meant for long-range sniping; it's for point-blank destruction. When you hit a creature with a melee attack using this weapon, you can expend 1 shell to trigger an explosion inside their guard. The target takes an extra [[/r 1d6]] Thunder damage.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Full Burst</strong></p><p>When you use your Shelling Strike, you can choose to expend up to 3 shells at once instead of just 1. The attack deals an extra [[/r 1d8]] Thunder damage for each shell expended this way.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Guard Reload</strong></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong></p><p>When a creature misses you with a melee attack while you are wielding the shield, you can use your Reaction to brace yourself and instantly reload up to 2 expended shells.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Blast Dash</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>You can use the weapon's recoil for extreme mobility. As a Bonus Action, you can expend 1 shell to propel yourself up to 20 feet in a straight line. This movement does not provoke Opportunity Attacks. If you end this movement within reach of a hostile creature, you can make one melee weapon attack against it as part of the same Bonus Action.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Wyvern's Fire</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p><p>You can overheat the core for a massive payload. As an Action, you can expend 4 shells to unleash a devastating blast of fire and concussive force. Creatures in a 30-foot cone must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Strength modifier). They take [[/r 4d6]] Fire damage and [[/r 4d6]] Thunder damage on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one. Once you use this feature, you cannot use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Push)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Artillery Shells</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Shelling Upgrade</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Shelling Strike</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Full Burst</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Guard Reload</strong></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Blast Dash</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Wyvern's Fire</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p></div>"
    },
